            <column caption='BaseLine 3KR1 - Launch 3 major benefits in all countries' datatype='integer' name='[BaseLine 1KR7 - Minimize Dmarts creation to near pickup time (copy)_310185427523080198]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='Running_Sum(IF ATTR(YEAR([fecha])) = 2021 AND ATTR(MONTH([fecha])) = 11 THEN SUM([federated.0mgoa1p1vu22vk13xu4el0ghsm1n].[O3_KR1]) end)'>
